add("faction.atk.desc", "从海上一路打上去：先抢滩前哨岛 A，再登陆主岛拿下港口 C 和机场 D，最后攻下指挥部 E。上了主岛以后可以直接在目标前面的攻击出发阵地出生。每阵亡一人兵力少 1，兵力打光就输。",
  "Fight your way in from the sea: storm Outpost A, land on the main island to take Port C and Airfield D, then seize Command E. Once ashore, spawn at the assault position in front of each objective. Every death costs one reinforcement; run out and you lose.")
add("faction.def.desc", "一道防线一道防线地守：守住当前的据点，把攻方的兵力耗光、或者拖到时间结束就赢。据点被压着时在后方集结点出生。",
  "Hold the line, sector by sector: defend the current objectives until the attackers run out of reinforcements or time. Spawn at the rally point behind a contested objective.")
