add("air.mouseAimOff", "纯键盘驾驶：W / S 俯仰、A / D 滚转、Q / E 方向舵，按住右键拖动自由看（M 切换）", "Keyboard flight: W/S pitch, A/D roll, Q/E rudder, hold RMB to look around (M toggles)")
