add("air.ovrOnTvc", "迎角限制已解除（推力矢量）：低速一直拉杆能原地翻一圈（库尔比特），踩舵原地甩头；松杆飞控拉回（T 恢复）", "AoA limiter OFF (thrust vectoring): hold aft stick at low speed to flip in place (Kulbit), rudder to snap the nose; release to recover (T restores)")
