add("map.city.mode", "城市战", "URBAN WARFARE")
add("map.city.desc", "两边基地各带一条跑道，中间一座城（约 2 公里见方）：老城街坊、高楼、公园、火车站、钢厂、电视塔 · 树撞得倒、炸得倒，楼炸多了会塌",
  "Each side's main base has its own runway; a city sits in between (about 2 km across): old blocks, towers, a park, the rail station, a steel works and a TV tower · trees fall when rammed or shot, buildings collapse")
add("map.sands.name", "沙海", "SEA OF SAND")
add("map.sands.mode", "突破", "BREAKTHROUGH")
add("map.sands.desc", "海湾战争式的纯陆地沙漠（约 28 公里见方）：从南边的前进基地北上，五个阶段一个一个打 · 沙墙、油田、镇子、空军基地、岭上指挥部", "A Gulf War desert with no sea (about 28 km across): push north from the forward base through five stages · border berm, oilfield, town, airbase, ridge command")
