add("hud.tip.2", "看屏幕上方的目标，再跟着菱形标记走。进入据点圈后，上方会显示占领进度。攻方要在圈内取得人数优势，才能推进占领。", "Follow the objective at the top of the screen and its diamond marker. The capture meter appears inside the zone. Attackers must outnumber defenders in the zone to advance it.")
add("hud.tip.3", "地图上的载具生成点按 E 生成坦克、直升机、飞机和艇，走过去按 E 上车。", "Press E at a vehicle pad to spawn tanks, helicopters, jets and boats; walk up and press E to get in.")
